<programme start="20261110083000 +0000" stop="20261110113000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Louisville at Georgia Tech</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Cardinals (5-3, 4-2) vie for their fourth straight victory as they visit the ACC rival Yellow Jackets (2-6, 1-3). The sides have split four engagements. Louisville quarterback Lincoln Kienholz has accounted for 10 touchdowns during the streak.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
