<programme start="20261111000000 +0000" stop="20261111020000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Wyoming at North Carolina</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Wyoming Cowboys visit the North Carolina Tar Heels for an NCAA Division I game in North Carolina. Wyoming rides a two-game win streak alongside guard Khaden Bennett, and North Carolina rides a two-game win streak alongside guard Matt Able.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111020000 +0000" stop="20261111040000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Bucknell at Virginia</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Bucknell Bison visit the No. 9 Virginia Cavaliers for an NCAA Division I game in Virginia. Bucknell comes off a 96-67 loss to Maryland alongside guard Aleksander Pachucki, and Virginia rides a three-game win streak with forward Thijs De Ridder.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
