<programme start="20261110163500 +0000" stop="20261110171900 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">Look Into My Eyes: Absorb Attention</sub-title><desc lang="en">At North Port High School in Florida, three students die within months of each other; as the community learns more, they discover a common thread: all three students were hypnotized by their principal, Dr. George Kenney, not long before they died.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261110171900 +0000" stop="20261110180300 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">Look Into My Eyes: Bypass the Critical</sub-title><desc lang="en">Dr. George Kenney begins to reveal his side of the story; as details emerge about the deaths and Marcus, Wesley and Brittany&apos;s parents speak out, an investigation into Kenney&apos;s hypnosis practice begins; the North Port community grows suspicious.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261110180300 +0000" stop="20261110184700 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">Look Into My Eyes: Activate the Unconscious</sub-title><desc lang="en">The press catches wind of the story, and it captures headlines worldwide; Dr. Kenney is asked to leave North Port High, and as the criminal trial heats up, the community is split on his culpability; a student comes forward with a new perspective.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261110184700 +0000" stop="20261110193100 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">Look Into My Eyes: The Outcome</sub-title><desc lang="en">Pressure mounts against the school board to take accountability; Dr. Kenney leaves North Port for what seems like the final time; the community grapples with guilt and grief; Stephen offers an intimate look into Kenney&apos;s hypnosis practice.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
