<programme start="20261111041300 +0000" stop="20261111045600 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story: It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here</title><sub-title lang="en">Mayfield, Kentucky</sub-title><desc lang="en">When a young mother is found murdered behind the middle school, multiple law enforcement agencies struggle to solve the case; a local amateur sleuth takes the investigation into her own hands and leads to a breakthrough.</desc><category lang="en">Drama</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20605209_b_v8_ah.jpg"/></programme>
