<programme start="20261110233000 +0000" stop="20261111013000 +0000" channel="BIG Network"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">NJIT at Rutgers</sub-title><desc lang="en">The NJIT Highlanders visit the Rutgers Scarlet Knights for an NCAA Division I game. NJIT recently broke a two-game skid with guard Victor Vanderstraeten, and Rutgers comes off an 81-54 win over New Haven playing inside Jersey Mike&apos;s Arena.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111013000 +0000" stop="20261111033000 +0000" channel="BIG Network"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Fairfield at Wisconsin</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Fairfield Stags visit the Wisconsin Badgers for an NCAA Division I game in Madison. Fairfield comes off a 68-59 win over Bryant alongside guard Declan Wucherpfennig, and Wisconsin rides a two-game win streak with guard Eian Elmer at Kohl Center.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
