<programme start="20261111210000 +0000" stop="20261111220000 +0000" channel="Food Network US"><title lang="en">Guy&apos;s Grocery Games</title><sub-title lang="en">Fieri Family Holiday Showdown</sub-title><desc lang="en">Guy Fieri&apos;s two sons and nephew face off; Guy pairs each family member with their very own all-star chef partner, but he also gives each team a Secret Santa box full of weird ingredients to use.</desc><category lang="en">Food</category><category lang="en">Game Shows</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p10181605_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111220000 +0000" stop="20261111230000 +0000" channel="Food Network US"><title lang="en">Guy&apos;s Grocery Games</title><sub-title lang="en">GGG Best Buddies Holiday Special</sub-title><desc lang="en">Guy Fieri teams up some of his friends from the Best Buddies volunteer organization with some all-star chefs for a holiday cook-off; the teams have one hour to make a holiday entrée and dessert for a chance to earn $15,000 for their teammate.</desc><category lang="en">Food</category><category lang="en">Game Shows</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p10181605_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
