<programme start="20261111210000 +0000" stop="20261111230000 +0000" channel="Lifetime Movies"><title lang="en">Flowers in the Attic: The Origin</title><sub-title lang="en">Part 1: The Marriage</sub-title><desc lang="en">Olivia Winfield gives up her career, her home and her name to become Mrs. Malcolm Foxworth, the wife of the nation&apos;s wealthiest man. However, she soon realizes that life at Foxworth Hall is far from the fairy tale she imagined it would be.</desc><credits><actor>Jemima Rooper</actor><actor>Max Irons</actor><actor>Kelsey Grammer</actor></credits><category lang="en">Drama</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p22104737_e_h8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
