<programme start="20261111160000 +0000" stop="20261111170000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El clon</title><sub-title lang="es">Salud mental</sub-title><desc lang="es">Deusa reporta la desaparición de Léo. Edna se preocupa por la salud mental de Albieri. Durante la asamblea, Jade asegura que no quiere regresar con Said. Albieri le propone al padre Matioli crear un clon.</desc><credits><director>Jayme Monjardim</director><actor>Murilo Benício</actor><actor>Giovanna Antonelli</actor><actor>Letícia Sabatella</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Adriana Lessa</actor><actor>Vera Fischer</actor><actor>Reginaldo Faria</actor><actor>Dalton Vigh</actor><actor>Daniela Escobar</actor><actor>Débora Falabella</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Antonio Calloni</actor><actor>Stênio Garcia</actor><actor>Jandira Martini</actor><actor>Neuza Borges</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Nívea Maria</actor><actor>Solange Couto</actor><actor>Osmar Prado</actor><actor>Cissa Guimarães</actor><actor>Marcos Frota</actor><actor>Sthefany Brito</actor></credits><date>20261110</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.145.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E146</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/8859963626029c6504b0342874aa7dfd.jpeg"/></programme>
